uter setempat, bukan pemain berbilang dalam talian atau pertaruhan. Ia menggunakan sasaran titik-5,000 biasa, pembahagian kad-15, tarikan dua kad dan ambang pembuka berdasar skor. Peraturan meja berbeza: versi ini tidak melaksanakan kebenaran perkongsian untuk keluar, bonus tangan tersembunyi khas, pilihan penggantian merah-tiga, atau peraturan rumah tersendiri. Jika stok tidak dapat menyediakan dua kad, pusingan dinilai."},"canasta-card-game.copy.privacy":{"context":"canasta-card-game UI copy.privacy","source_hash":"6b669c1a2c63757442b070d69b8a36a6a7270fa5f686c619418433d3d26d9567","translation":"Bebas untuk bermain. Tangan dan skor anda kekal dalam pelungsur ini pada peranti ini; tiada data permainan dimuatkan."}},"locale":"ms","missing":["canasta-card-game.copy.name","canasta-card-game.copy.title","canasta-card-game.copy.description","canasta-card-game.copy.exampleHeading","canasta-card-game.copy.example","canasta-card-game.copy.howItWorks","canasta-card-game.copy.details","canasta-card-game.copy.faqHeading","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.0.q","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.0.a","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.1.q","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.1.a","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.2.q","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.2.a","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.3.q","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.3.a","canasta-card-game.copy.faq.4.q","canasta-card-game.copy.limitsHeading","canasta-card-game.copy.useTool","canasta-card-game.copy.related","canasta-card-game.copy.freeBadge","canasta-card-game.copy.home","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.newGame","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.nextRound","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.resume","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.deleteSave","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.ready","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.you","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.computer","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.hand","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.opponentCards","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.stock","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.discard","canasta-card-game.copy.fields.melds","canasta-card-game.copy.field